  <string name="memorize_title">Memorize</string>
  <string name="memorize_disclaimer">Recite from memory: the words are hidden and appear as you recite them correctly. If you make a mistake or stop, the next word is given to you.\n\nEverything happens on this device. Your voice is not recorded unless you turn on recording in Settings; recordings stay on this device and are never backed up or sent.\n\nAutomatic feedback can be wrong and does not replace a qualified teacher.</string>
